url: >-
  https://github.com/AlecKriebel/Math/tree/k3p-level2-identifiability-v1.0.0/k3p_level2_identifiability_final
abstract: >-
  A necessary-and-sufficient classification of regular full-dimensional
  stochastic containment and generic structural identifiability for binary
  standard semi-directed strongly tree-child level-2 phylogenetic networks
  under the Kimura three-parameter model, including the common rank-14
  triangle hypersurface and a sharp weak-tree-child counterexample family.
keywords:
  - phylogenetic networks
  - Kimura three-parameter model
  - K3P
  - generic identifiability
  - directed containment
  - level-2 networks
  - strongly tree-child networks
  - algebraic statistics
  - computer-assisted proof
  - reproducible mathematics
